 "title": "The pitch of a passing siren",
 "caption": "Approaching at 30 m s⁻¹, the 700 Hz siren sounds at f = f₀v/(v − v_s) = 767 Hz; receding, f₀v/(v + v_s) = 644 Hz. The drop happens as it passes, quickly if it passes close by.",
