  "Approaching: 700 × 343 / (343 − 30) = 767.1 Hz.",
  "Receding: 700 × 343 / (343 + 30) = 643.7 Hz.",
  "At the moment of passing (10 m away) the siren moves across the line of sight, so you hear the true 700 Hz."
